      "rationale": "Heburukan kumasen gɛlɛyen — kiyɔrbɔla da ye kɔlɔkili-kun kɔnɔ walima a sanfɛ; bayɛlɛmabaga caman bɛ a fɔ cogo wɛrɛw la"
